---
layout: layouts/base.njk
---
{#
  Case study layout.

  Front matter each case study can set:
    title       — the case study name (page h1, homepage list, next-case-study link)
    standfirst  — one line describing the engagement, sits under the title
    client      — organisation name, shown in the homepage list
    period      — e.g. "2016 to 2018", shown in the homepage list
    meta        — list of key/value rows for the block under the standfirst, e.g.
                    meta:
                      - key: Role
                        value: Interaction and service designer
    heroImage     — path to an image for the left hand column of the hero,
                    e.g. /images/case-studies/guardian/funeralcare-poster.jpg
    heroImageAlt  — alt text for it
    order       — number, controls position in the list (lowest first)
    pageTitle / description — override the <title> and meta description

  The body is plain HTML, written as sections in the same shape as the homepage.

  A content section — 4 column decorative gutter + 8 column text:

    <section class="mt-section">
      <div class="coop-l-grid">
        <div class="coop-l-grid__item coop-l-grid__item--small-12 coop-l-grid__item--large-4 mt-section-bg-repeater"></div>
        <div class="coop-l-grid__item coop-l-grid__item--small-12 coop-l-grid__item--large-8">
          <h2>Heading</h2>
          <div class="mt-case-body">
            <p>…</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  An image row — one .coop-l-grid holding one, two or three items. Every item
  goes inside the SAME grid div or they will not sit on one line. Widths:

    one across    --small-12 --large-12
    two across    --small-12 --medium-6
    three across  --small-12 --medium-4

    <section class="mt-section">
      <div class="coop-l-grid">
        <div class="coop-l-grid__item coop-l-grid__item--small-12 coop-l-grid__item--medium-4">
          <figure class="mt-figure">
            <img src="/images/…" alt="…" />
            <figcaption class="mt-figure__caption">…</figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>
        … repeat for each image, inside the same grid div …
      </div>
    </section>

  Add mt-section--bg to the section for the sketched background. If the images
  in a row have different shapes, add mt-figure--crop to each figure so they
  are cropped to a common 3:4 portrait and the captions line up.

  Inside .mt-case-body you also get:
    <blockquote class="mt-quote"> … <footer class="mt-quote__source">Name, Job title</footer></blockquote>
#}
<article class="mt-case">
<div class="mt-case-study"> 
  <section class="mt-section mt-section--content">
    <div class="coop-l-grid">
      <div
        class="coop-l-grid__item coop-l-grid__item--small-12 coop-l-grid__item--large-4"
      >
        {% if heroImage %}
          <img
            src="{{ heroImage }}"
            class="mt-case-hero-image"
            alt="{{ heroImageAlt }}"
          />
        {% endif %}
      </div>
      <div
        class="coop-l-grid__item coop-l-grid__item--small-12 coop-l-grid__item--large-8 mt-stacking"
      >
        <p class="mt-case-kicker"><a href="/#case-studies">Case study</a></p>
        <h1 class="mt-case-title">{{ title | safe }}</h1>
        {% if standfirst %}
          <p class="mt-case-standfirst">{{ standfirst | safe }}</p>
        {% endif %}
        {% if meta %}
          <dl class="mt-case-meta">
            {% for row in meta %}
              <div class="mt-case-meta__pair">
                <dt class="mt-case-meta__key">{{ row.key | safe }}</dt>
                <dd class="mt-case-meta__value">{{ row.value | safe }}</dd>
              </div>
            {% endfor %}
          </dl>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  
    {{ content | safe }}
  </div>
  <section class="mt-section mt-section--last">
    <div class="coop-l-grid">
      <div
        class="coop-l-grid__item coop-l-grid__item--small-12 coop-l-grid__item--large-4 mt-section-bg-repeater"
      ></div>
      <div
        class="coop-l-grid__item coop-l-grid__item--small-12 coop-l-grid__item--large-8"
      >
        <nav class="mt-case-nav" aria-label="More case studies">
          {% for item in collections.caseStudies %}
            {% if item.url == page.url and not loop.last %}
              {% set next = collections.caseStudies[loop.index] %}
              <p class="mt-case-nav__key">Next case study</p>
              <p class="mt-case-nav__next"><a href="{{ next.url }}">{{ next.data.title | safe }}</a></p>
            {% endif %}
          {% endfor %}
          <p class="mt-case-nav__back"><a href="/#case-studies">All case studies</a></p>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</article>
